1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:05,228
On Mars, there is no doctor on board — and Earth takes 22 minutes to reply.

2
00:00:05,458 --> 00:00:11,444
Pulse-0G doesn't diagnose or dump numbers: it compares you to your baseline and guides action.

3
00:00:11,674 --> 00:00:18,619
Offline-first and never guesses. Missing data stays blank; unverified claims are struck out.

4
00:00:18,849 --> 00:00:24,254
Built on open NASA data, ready for European and Canadian orbital sensors.

5
00:00:24,484 --> 00:00:29,658
Pulse-0G: traceable health decisions.
